<title>USA: MBIA qualifies Harrison Cty CSD, Miss., sale.</title>
<headline>MBIA qualifies Harrison Cty CSD, Miss., sale.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp said it has added $23 million Harrison County School District, Miss., general obligation school bonds to the list of Wednesday's competitive issues it has qualified for bond insurance.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
